    },
    {
      "id": "u_7e8484b695ac0a82b7799286_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Now, to the parent note \"2022 Books\" you can assign label __TRILIUM_PH_0__.",
      "sourceHash": "7e8484b695ac0a82b77992868d5052ec6f06af3575f992ddfe09fc2e1f2c62c7",
      "context": "Default Note Title",
      "contextHash": "27cab928b981c71f55038d17a78b948ef5bc1065de8cc1981f96a55e79728069",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "ここで、親ノート「2022 Books」にラベル __TRILIUM_PH_0__ を割り当てることができます。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T14:14:05.465Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_b4dd645d332592a302538373_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "And all children of \"2022 Books\" will be created with initial title \"[Author name]: [Book title], [Publication year]\". There's no artificial intelligence here, the idea is to just prompt you to manually fill in the pieces of information into the note title by yourself.",
      "sourceHash": "b4dd645d332592a30253837348279d8e37c332a1328af3a3c6b2f98335f51ebf",
      "context": "Default Note Title",
      "contextHash": "27cab928b981c71f55038d17a78b948ef5bc1065de8cc1981f96a55e79728069",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "すると、「2022 Books」のすべての子は、初期タイトル「[Author name]: [Book title], [Publication year]」で作成されます。ここには人工知能はなく、ノートのタイトルに情報の断片をご自身で手動で入力するよう促すことが目的です。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T14:14:05.465Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_2bfe964e02cfe993e28d1160_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Titles set by a template__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "2bfe964e02cfe993e28d11603428f708b3e658e0d2dd794917bd6108a4772203",
      "context": "Default Note Title > Titles set by a template",
      "contextHash": "cd709c87a80926c138e0762b758695f25bfc1485f77b17a4c213c59205b6c3ae",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "テンプレートによって設定されるタイトル__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T14:14:05.465Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_cdb6eaf5ccb202a9e30d97ff_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "A template can name the notes created from it, wherever they are created. To do so, add a __TRILIUM_PH_0__ label to the template note, for example __TRILIUM_PH_1__ on a __TRILIUM_PH_2__Meeting__TRILIUM_PH_3__ template.",
      "sourceHash": "cdb6eaf5ccb202a9e30d97ff641b571973cf1878317a380389b14094b3f13ac2",
      "context": "Default Note Title > Titles set by a template",
      "contextHash": "cd709c87a80926c138e0762b758695f25bfc1485f77b17a4c213c59205b6c3ae",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "テンプレートを使用すると、どこで作成された場合でも、そのテンプレートから作成されるノートに名前を付けることができます。これを行うには、テンプレートノートに __TRILIUM_PH_0__ ラベルを追加します。例えば、__TRILIUM_PH_1____TRILIUM_PH_2__ミーティング__TRILIUM_PH_3__テンプレートに設定します。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-16T10:18:13.154Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_c14d64bea73ee3342c4a06c5_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "It applies both when the template is picked explicitly and when it comes from a parent's __TRILIUM_PH_0__. See __TRILIUM_PH_1__Templates__TRILIUM_PH_2__.",
      "sourceHash": "c14d64bea73ee3342c4a06c58e3f236f09d75182a46fedf4bc88719c6c23379e",
      "context": "Default Note Title > Titles set by a template",
      "contextHash": "cd709c87a80926c138e0762b758695f25bfc1485f77b17a4c213c59205b6c3ae",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "これは、テンプレートが明示的に選択された場合と、親の __TRILIUM_PH_0__ から取得された場合の双方が適用されます。__TRILIUM_PH_1__Templates__TRILIUM_PH_2__ を参照してください。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T14:14:05.465Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_75e4e9d01e3958e05362e099_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "It takes precedence over the parent's __TRILIUM_PH_0__. A title typed in by the user always wins.",
      "sourceHash": "75e4e9d01e3958e05362e09913e0de213e5b64aeda69a6863029dce60b99a089",
      "context": "Default Note Title > Titles set by a template",
      "contextHash": "cd709c87a80926c138e0762b758695f25bfc1485f77b17a4c213c59205b6c3ae",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "これは親の __TRILIUM_PH_0__ よりも優先されます。ユーザーが入力したタイトルが常に優先されます。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T14:14:05.465Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_b3a3ef1a566202beb379f88a_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "It can be inherited from the template's ancestors in the tree (for example, a folder holding several templates), in which case a label owned by the template itself takes precedence. A note created from a template and later marked as a template does not keep that template's title.",
      "sourceHash": "b3a3ef1a566202beb379f88abed09409b38221b37952c86b0b578946c6f0b322",
      "context": "Default Note Title > Titles set by a template",
      "contextHash": "cd709c87a80926c138e0762b758695f25bfc1485f77b17a4c213c59205b6c3ae",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "ツリー内のテンプレートの祖先（たとえば、複数のテンプレートを保持するフォルダ）から継承することもできます。その場合、テンプレート自体が持つラベルが優先されます。テンプレートから作成され、後にテンプレートとしてマークされたノートは、そのテンプレートのタイトルを保持しません。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T14:14:05.465Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_4f623e4db045f791b416122d_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Its value is evaluated the same way as __TRILIUM_PH_0__, with __TRILIUM_PH_1__ being the parent of the new note.",
      "sourceHash": "4f623e4db045f791b416122daf06ca7650c4c741fc3a3258c589dbd21484f363",
      "context": "Default Note Title > Titles set by a template",
      "contextHash": "cd709c87a80926c138e0762b758695f25bfc1485f77b17a4c213c59205b6c3ae",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "その値は __TRILIUM_PH_0__ と同様の方法で評価され、__TRILIUM_PH_1__ は新しいノートの親になります。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T14:14:05.465Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_3f3ea830840d50f8f9d1f5a6_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Dynamic value__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "3f3ea830840d50f8f9d1f5a6f00b1683dc0173a9f60aee9dc6f0288a4537b8cc",
      "context": "Default Note Title > Dynamic value",
      "contextHash": "f51ed631b551add3821b6fde8bb3ca2df399b4718da2dde4c759f4329576b820",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "動的な値__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T14:14:05.465Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_7752864938fcbf7abe596bd1_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "The value of __TRILIUM_PH_0__ is evaluated at the point of note's creation as a JavaScript string, which means it can be enriched with the help of JS string interpolation with dynamic data.",
      "sourceHash": "7752864938fcbf7abe596bd1096be9f9fcb82de4a1155f0886873984da624880",
      "context": "Default Note Title > Dynamic value",
      "contextHash": "f51ed631b551add3821b6fde8bb3ca2df399b4718da2dde4c759f4329576b820",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__ の値はノート作成時にJavaScriptの文字列として評価されます。つまり、JSの文字列補間を利用して動的なデータを追加できるということです。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T14:14:05.465Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_66633edb7ca7d236aafebccb_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Second variable injected is __TRILIUM_PH_0__ which gives access to the parent __TRILIUM_PH_1____TRILIUM_PH_2____TRILIUM_PH_3__.",
      "sourceHash": "66633edb7ca7d236aafebccb0906604198c17fdb95ba63deee890daed6bee836",
      "context": "Default Note Title > Dynamic value",
      "contextHash": "f51ed631b551add3821b6fde8bb3ca2df399b4718da2dde4c759f4329576b820",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "注入される2番目の変数は __TRILIUM_PH_0__ であり、親の __TRILIUM_PH_1____TRILIUM_PH_2____TRILIUM_PH_3__ にアクセスできます。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T14:14:05.465Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_52d929a38319572458cb39b2_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "See also __TRILIUM_PH_0__Templates__TRILIUM_PH_1__ which provides similar capabilities, including default note's content.",
      "sourceHash": "52d929a38319572458cb39b2ad1541b180704ec9a15892aed1e747e4194c4795",
      "context": "Default Note Title > Dynamic value",
      "contextHash": "f51ed631b551add3821b6fde8bb3ca2df399b4718da2dde4c759f4329576b820",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "ノートのデフォルトコンテンツなど、同様の機能を提供する __TRILIUM_PH_0__テンプレート__TRILIUM_PH_1__ も参照してください。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T14:14:05.465Z"
    },
    {
