    {
      "id": "u_84fc7cd8377ff3f115130c79_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "You can automatize the date assignment by assigning a label __TRILIUM_PH_0__ to the parent note \"Incidents\". Whenever a new child note is created, the title template is evaluated with the injected __TRILIUM_PH_1__now__TRILIUM_PH_2__ object.",
